# Safe live Tick installation requires:
# - kind=Tick
# - patch_offset=0
# - patch_size=4
# - expected = exactly one AArch64 instruction
# - the first instruction must not be an indirect branch/return or PC-relative instruction
# - the executable target must match the exact loaded build ID
