# The runtime changes only one 32-bit instruction at the target to a B veneer.
# The veneer loads the per-hook context and enters the universal register-preserving
# Tick stub. The trampoline executes the original instruction and resumes at +4.
#
# The installer refuses the plan on an unsupported architecture, unknown build,
# non-unique signature, expected-byte mismatch, unsafe relocation, out-of-range
# branch, or failed executable-page permission change.


